# Mix masters. WAVs are 600MB-1.2GB each and never leave the machine —
# only the AAC copy is uploaded. See CLAUDE.md, Music.
# Leading slash is load-bearing: git sets core.ignorecase=true on macOS, so an
# unanchored `Music/` also matches `app/(site)/music/` and silently un-tracks
# the route — a site that builds clean locally and 404s in production.
/Music/
